        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Weslock 6685, Woodward Dummy Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern handleset made by Weslock is distinguished by square mounts and sleek design. It is bold enough to make a contemporary statement yet simple enough to melt seamlessly into almost any decor. Available in satin nickel and black finishes. A dummy handleset, the Modern Weslock Woodward Dummy Handleset is just for looks; it neither latches nor locks. Dummy handlesets are most often used as a pull or on the inactive side of double doors to match the existing trim. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset does not function--neither locking nor latching.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available matching: \r\n<a href=\"/products/modern-woodward-i-single-cylinder-handleset-weslock-6681-6200\"><b>Woodward Single Cylinder Handleset</b></a>\r\n\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis modern styled handleset is from the <a href=\"/collections/weslock-elegance-collection\"><b>Weslock Elegance Collection</b></a> which features lifetime finish and mechanical warranties.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Weslock Woodward Dummy Entrance Set:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: solid brass</li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Manufacturer Limited 10 Year Finish Warranty</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Elegance Collection Modern Weslock Woodward Dummy Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 18-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 10-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Width: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>The inside trim will match the handleset's finish.</i>\r\n</p>",
